# HR Analytics Dashboard | Power BI

## Project Overview
This project analyzes workforce data using Microsoft Power BI to support HR reporting and data-driven decision-making.

## Objectives
- Analyze total and active employee headcount.
- Monitor employee terminations.
- Compare average salaries across departments.
- Examine gender distribution and performance ratings.
- Track hiring trends over time.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- DAX
- Data visualization and HR analytics

## Key Performance Indicators
- Total Employees: 500
- Active Employees: 408
- Terminated Employees: 92
- Displayed Termination Proportion: 18.4%
- Average Salary: 88.26K

## Business Recommendations
- Investigate employee exit reasons and retention patterns.
- Review salary differences across departments.
- Identify opportunities for training and performance improvement.
- Align recruitment planning with workforce requirements.

